 "2022_265_may_2022_pcard_report": {
  "paragraph": "Troy School District's purchasing-card (PCARD) report for May 2022, carried on the Board of Education agenda of July 26, 2022, itemizes every district PCARD transaction posted under the journal-entry description MAY PCARD EXP, with transaction dates running from 4/26/2022 through 5/25/2022. Each line lists the merchant and transaction date, the budget unit charged, an account code, and either a transaction amount or a credit. The report ends with a printed subtotal of 375,951.02 in charges against 8,418.50 in credits and a printed Total Expenses line of 367,532.52. The listing spans 34 numbered pages, each footed with the date 7/20/2022.",
  "page": "**Document type and identification**\n\nRecurring monthly purchasing-card (PCARD) transaction listing for Troy School District, headed \"TROY SCHOOL DISTRICT, PCARD report, May 2022\" on each of the 34 numbered pages, every footer carrying the run date 7/20/2022. It appeared on the Board of Education agenda for July 26, 2022.\n\n**Layout**\n\nColumns: Transaction Description, JE Description, Budget Unit, A/C Code, Transaction Amount, and Credits. The Transaction Description field concatenates the posting date and a truncated merchant name. Every line carries the same JE Description, MAY PCARD EXP. Refunds and reversals appear in the Credits column.\n\n**Printed totals**\n\n| Line | Amount |\n| --- | --- |\n| Subtotal (transaction amounts) | 375,951.02 |\n| Subtotal (credits) | 8,418.50 |\n| Total Expenses | 367,532.52 |\n\n**Largest single charges**\n\n| Date | Merchant | Budget unit / A/C | Amount |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 5/6/2022 | ROSY BROS IN | 101904261870000 / 6410 | 8,950.00 |\n| 5/4/2022 | MAC & RAYS | 700074399732200 / 5000 | 7,810.42 |\n| 5/2/2022 | C & G PUBLIS | 101928282087400 / 3510 | 7,635.72 |\n| 5/13/2022 | CODEREVKIDS. | 120071127375000 / 7910 | 6,887.00 |\n| 5/25/2022 | TIM KAISER S | 700051299323500 / 5000 | 6,779.76 |\n| 5/17/2022 | OFF2CLASS | 120315125684600 / 3450 | 5,700.00 |\n| 5/16/2022 | BIANCO TOURS | 700053299393000 / 5000 | 5,246.82 |\n| 5/5/2022 | FESTIVALS OF | 700052299700000 / 5000 | 5,029.00 |\n| 5/20/2022 | TROY HISTORI | 700053299393000 / 5000 | 4,288.00 |\n| 5/24/2022 | CEDAR POINT | 700053299393000 / 5000 | 4,270.00 |\n| 4/29/2022 | BOOK BEAT | 101008111100100 / 5110 | 4,025.23 |\n| 5/2/2022 | NASSP PRODUC | 700070399710000 / 5000 | 3,942.75 |\n\n**Largest credits**\n\n| Date | Merchant | Budget unit / A/C | Credit |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 5/9/2022 | AMAZON.COM A | 101180222374100 / 5110 | 1,351.84 |\n| 5/13/2022 | AMAZON.COM | 101180222374100 / 5110 | 1,351.84 |\n| 5/2/2022 | PAYPAL *READ | 101425221042600 / 3220 | 800.00 |\n| 5/9/2022 | AMZN MKTP US | 101905261811000 / 4120 | 700.00 |\n| 5/23/2022 | AMZN MKTP US | 120007111698810 / 5110 | 629.00 |\n| 5/23/2022 | DELTA 00 | 101425221320900 / 3220 | 537.20 |\n| 4/27/2022 | PB *WASH IS | 101425221042600 / 3220 | 450.00 |\n| 5/16/2022 | HILTON HOTEL | 101070127511000 / 3220 | 312.75 |\n\n**Recurring blocks**\n\nBudget unit 101425221042600, account 3220, absorbs the report's most repetitive travel activity: a long run of HYATT OAK BR lodging charges of 346.62 each dated 4/29/2022, EMPIRE HOTEL charges of 480.60 each dated 5/16/2022, and repeated PAYPAL *READ charges of 800.00 each between 4/26/2022 and 5/25/2022, along with New York-area taxi, restaurant and airport-parking charges (NYC TAXI 124 at 55.90, 57.95 and 56.20; JAKE S STEAK at 478.27; METRO AIRPOR at 78.00).\n\n**Spending character**\n\nMost lines are small classroom and office purchases from AMZN MKTP US, AMAZON.COM, numbered Staples store accounts, Kroger, Meijer, Target, The Home Depot, Lowe's and Sam's Club. Larger discrete items cover field trips and admissions (DETROIT ZOOL, THE HENRY FO, TROY HISTORI, BOWERS FARM, YMCA CAMP CO, CEDAR POINT), curriculum and instructional materials (CENGAGE LEAR, PROLITERACY, SCHOLASTIC, FOLLETT SCHO, THE READING, AWL*PEARSON, FLINN SCIENT, CAROLINA BIO, BOOKSOURCE), technology (APPLE.COM/US, APPLE STORE, MSFT *AZURE, ZOOM.US, SMARTSHEET I, MONOPRICE, EBAY O*), grounds and facilities (SITEONE LAND, TELLY'S NURS, MUNN TRACTOR, ROSY BROS IN, ULINE *SHIP), and conference registration and travel (MASB, MSBO, MICHIGAN WOR, NASP ONLINE, MACAE, CASAS, LINDAMOOD-BE, INT*BACCALAU).",
  "verbose": "**Identification and scope**\n\nMonthly purchasing-card transaction register titled \"TROY SCHOOL DISTRICT, PCARD report, May 2022,\" placed before the Troy School District Board of Education for the meeting of July 26, 2022. The header row - Transaction Description, JE Description, Budget Unit, A/C Code, Transaction Amount, Credits - is repeated at the top of each of the 34 numbered pages, and each page footer shows the run date 7/20/2022. Every line shares the journal-entry description MAY PCARD EXP. Posting dates on individual lines run from 4/26/2022 through 5/25/2022.\n\n**Printed totals**\n\nThe register closes with a Subtotal line showing 375,951.02 in the Transaction Amount column and 8,418.50 in the Credits column, followed by a Total Expenses line of 367,532.52.\n\n**Account codes in use**\n\nLines are coded to A/C values including 3190, 3220 (travel/conference), 3311, 3410, 3430 (postage), 3450 (software/subscriptions), 3510 (advertising/publication), 3610, 4120 (repair/maintenance), 4220, 5000 (student-activity/agency expenditure), 5110 (instructional supplies), 5210, 5310, 5910, 5990, 6410 (equipment), 7410 and 7910. Budget units named repeatedly include 419160225407500, 529202229660000, 529202391660000, 530212351701000, 531004118620000, 535070261095200 and 535071261095200, alongside a long list of general-fund, grant and student-activity units.\n\n**Largest individual charges**\n\nThe single biggest line is ROSY BROS IN on 5/6/2022 for 8,950.00 against budget unit 101904261870000, account 6410. Other large charges include MAC & RAYS on 5/4/2022 for 7,810.42 (700074399732200); C & G PUBLIS on 5/2/2022 for 7,635.72 (101928282087400, account 3510); CODEREVKIDS. on 5/13/2022 for 6,887.00 (120071127375000, account 7910); TIM KAISER S on 5/25/2022 for 6,779.76 (700051299323500); OFF2CLASS on 5/17/2022 for 5,700.00 (120315125684600, account 3450); BIANCO TOURS on 5/16/2022 for 5,246.82 (700053299393000); FESTIVALS OF on 5/5/2022 for 5,029.00 (70